      <mxCell id="cause-rules" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;CONTROLES COMBINACIONALES DESDE ACTION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Por defecto: TAKE = 0; LD_ERR = 0; SEL_ERR = 0; FIN_*_EVT = 0.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;A_PLL_ERROR / A_HS_ERROR: LD_ERR = 1, SEL_ERR = 1; PLL_CAUSE distingue 01 / 10.&lt;br/&gt;A_INVALID: LD_ERR = 1, SEL_ERR = 2. A_CLEAR: LD_ERR = 1, SEL_ERR = 0.&lt;br/&gt;A_TAKE_LP / A_TAKE_HS activan TAKE_LP / TAKE_HS.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;FIN_LP_EVT = !rst &amp;amp; (ACTION == A_FIN_LP)&lt;br/&gt;FIN_HS_EVT = !rst &amp;amp; (ACTION == A_FIN_HS)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;La decisión de éxito usa fase + stop_ready en ↑clk. Su aplicación es en ↓clk. Con rst activo todos los controles de acción se bloquean." vertex="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#5c708a;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=22;fontColor=#172b4d;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=20;fillColor=#f6f8fb;strokeColor=#bccbdc;">
        <mxGeometry x="2010" y="1270" width="1270" height="480" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="reset-rules" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;RESET · AMBOS FLANCOS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inmediato:&lt;/b&gt; bloquear grants, órdenes y req_ready; phy_abort = 1.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;↑clk:&lt;/b&gt; STATE ← IDLE; ACTION ← A_NONE. busy cae al registrar IDLE.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;↓clk:&lt;/b&gt; CAUSA y FIN_* ← 0; R_LP/R_HS ← 1; PREF ← 0.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Mantener rst durante un ciclo completo. Cada registro tiene reset síncrono a su propio flanco." vertex="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#5c708a;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=22;fontColor=#172b4d;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=20;fillColor=#f6f8fb;strokeColor=#bccbdc;">
        <mxGeometry x="160" y="2170" width="1480" height="360" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="mask-rules" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;FRONTERA FSM / DATAPATH&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;EN_ARB = !rst &amp;amp; ARB_LIBRE &amp;amp; stop_ready&lt;br/&gt;HS_FAULT = HS_ACTIVE &amp;amp; (!pll_locked | hs_error)&lt;br/&gt;Y = R &amp;amp; {6{!rst &amp;amp; !HS_FAULT}}&lt;br/&gt;phy_abort = rst | FAULT_ACTIVE | HS_FAULT&lt;br/&gt;error = !rst &amp;amp; FAULT_ACTIVE; busy = BUSY_CTRL&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;FIRE se acepta en ↑clk; TAKE se conserva hasta ↓clk.&lt;br/&gt;La FSM tiene STATE [4] + ACTION [4], con salidas always @(*).&lt;br/&gt;El datapath tiene siete bits en ↓clk.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Total: 15 bits lógicos. En fault, causa válida desde ↓clk posterior; error y órdenes combinacionales reflejan la fase antes de ese flanco." vertex="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#5c708a;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=22;fontColor=#172b4d;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=20;fillColor=#f6f8fb;strokeColor=#bccbdc;">
        <mxGeometry x="2010" y="1870" width="1270" height="550" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="footer" parent="1" value="La codificación usa diez valores de cuatro bits; la síntesis podría recodificarla. FSM funcional para una PHY modelada: sin tiempos eléctricos, serialización ni pads.&lt;br/&gt;En FAULT se ignoran nuevos done y solicitudes. El fallo solo se limpia con reposo confirmado; una solicitud consumida no se reintenta hasta rearmarse." vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=22;fontColor=#172b4d;fontSize=19;fontColor=#42526e;">
        <mxGeometry x="70" y="2710" width="3280" height="115" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    </root>
  </mxGraphModel>
</diagram><diagram id="rtl-timing" name="9 · RTL · Contrato temporal">
  <mxGraphModel grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="3300" pageHeight="2300" background="#ffffff">
    <root>
      <mxCell id="0" />
      <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
      <mxCell id="title" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;DPHY_MODE_CTRL · RTL · CONTRATO ENTRE FLANCOS&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=22;fontColor=#172b4d;fontSize=32;">
        <mxGeometry x="70" y="30" width="3160" height="65" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="subtitle" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;UC ↑clk · señales combinacionales · datapath ↓clk&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;40 MHz: periodo 25 ns, separación entre flancos 12,5 ns. Conservar la acción evita perder controles cuando cambia STATE." vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=22;fontColor=#172b4d;">
        <mxGeometry x="70" y="115" width="3160" height="110" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="seq" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;MEMORIA DE CONTROL · ↑clk&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;always @(posedge clk)&lt;br/&gt;Reset / prioridad / case (STATE)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;STATE [4]&lt;/b&gt; conserva uno de diez estados.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;ACTION [4]&lt;/b&gt; conserva la decisión del flanco.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Acciones: NONE, TAKE_LP, TAKE_HS,&lt;br/&gt;PLL_ERROR, HS_ERROR, INVALID,&lt;br/&gt;CLEAR, FIN_LP, FIN_HS.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;ACTION ← NONE en cada ↑clk sin evento.&lt;br/&gt;No se calcula next_state combinacional." vertex="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#5b7fa6;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=22;fontColor=#172b4d;">
        <mxGeometry x="70" y="350" width="850" height="600" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="comb" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;SALIDAS DE FSM · COMBINACIONALES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;always @(*)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Decodificar STATE:&lt;br/&gt;ARB_LIBRE, HS_ACTIVE, FAULT_ACTIVE,&lt;br/&gt;BUSY_CTRL e intenciones R[6].&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Decodificar ACTION:&lt;br/&gt;TAKE_LP / TAKE_HS, LD_ERR, SEL_ERR,&lt;br/&gt;PLL_CAUSE, FIN_LP_EVT / FIN_HS_EVT.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;No hay flip-flops en las salidas de UC." vertex="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#5b7fa6;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=22;fontColor=#172b4d;">
        <mxGeometry x="1240" y="350" width="820" height="600" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="dp" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;DATAPATH · ↓clk&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;always @(negedge clk)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;R_LP [1] · R_HS [1] · PREF [1]&lt;br/&gt;CAUSA [2] · FIN_LP [1] · FIN_HS [1]&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;M0/M1: rearme o consumo de req.&lt;br/&gt;M2: preferencia por TAKE.&lt;br/&gt;M3/M4: causa decidida y retenida.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Causa y pulsos aparecen después de ↓clk.&lt;br/&gt;Reset tiene prioridad sobre carga." vertex="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#5b7fa6;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=22;fontColor=#172b4d;">
        <mxGeometry x="2360" y="350" width="850" height="600" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="e1" parent="1" source="seq" target="comb" value="STATE + ACTION [8]" edge="1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeColor=#344563;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;">
        <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="e2" parent="1" source="comb" target="dp" value="controles estables hasta ↓clk" edge="1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeColor=#344563;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;">
        <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="e3" parent="1" source="dp" target="seq" value="LP_FIRE / HS_FIRE / HS_FAULT [3]" edge="1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeColor=#344563;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;">
        <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
          <Array as="points">
            <mxPoint x="2785" y="1100" />
            <mxPoint x="495" y="1100" />
          </Array>
        </mxGeometry>
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="timeline-title" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;EJEMPLO · FIN LP CON stop_ready = 1 EN ↑N&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=22;fontColor=#172b4d;fontSize=26;">
        <mxGeometry x="70" y="1210" width="3100" height="60" as="geometry" />
